          "replacement_region_source": "{\n    // SAFETY: `leaves` was allocated for `n` Nodes, and only the first\n    // `numsymbols` entries were initialized and are used here. This mutable\n    // slice is confined to this block and does not outlive the allocation.\n    let leaves_slice = unsafe { core::slice::from_raw_parts_mut(leaves, numsymbols as usize) };\n    leaves_slice.sort_unstable_by(|a, b| a.weight.cmp(&b.weight));\n}\nfor leaf in unsafe {\n    // SAFETY: same initialized `numsymbols` prefix of `leaves` as above;\n    // the slice is used only within this loop and does not alias any live\n    // Rust reference across the region.\n    core::slice::from_raw_parts_mut(leaves, numsymbols as usize)\n}\n.iter_mut()\n{\n    leaf.weight >>= 9 as c_int;\n}\nif (numsymbols - 1 as c_int) < maxbits {\n    maxbits = numsymbols - 1 as c_int;\n}\nnodes = malloc(\n    ((maxbits * 2 as c_int * numsymbols) as size_t)\n        .wrapping_mul(::core::mem::size_of::<Node>() as size_t),\n) as *mut Node;\npool.next = nodes;\nlists = malloc(\n    (maxbits as size_t).wrapping_mul(::core::mem::size_of::<[*mut Node; 2]>() as size_t),\n) as *mut [*mut Node; 2];\nInitLists(&raw mut pool, leaves, maxbits, lists);\nnumBoundaryPMRuns = 2 as c_int * numsymbols - 4 as c_int;\ni = 0 as c_int;\nwhile i < numBoundaryPMRuns - 1 as c_int {\n    BoundaryPM(\n        lists,\n        leaves,\n        numsymbols,\n        &raw mut pool,\n        maxbits - 1 as c_int,\n    );\n    i += 1;\n}\nBoundaryPMFinal(\n    lists,\n    leaves,\n    numsymbols,\n    &raw mut pool,\n    maxbits - 1 as c_int,\n);\nlet last_list = unsafe {\n    // SAFETY: `lists` was allocated for `maxbits` elements just above, and\n    // `maxbits - 1` is in-bounds because earlier logic ensures `maxbits >= 1`\n    // for the remaining control-flow paths.\n    &*lists.offset((maxbits - 1 as c_int) as isize)\n};\nlet extract_root = last_list[1 as c_int as usize];\nExtractBitLengths(extract_root, leaves, bitlengths);\nfree(lists as *mut c_void);\nfree(leaves as *mut c_void);\nfree(nodes as *mut c_void);\nreturn 0 as c_int;",
          "rule_id": "III①,III④,C3"
        }
